dtk-qt6 (1.7.1-2~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial NeuroDebian packaging, ported from the neurofedora dtk-qt6.spec.
    Qt6 fork of the Inria dtk platform, built library-only (no apps, tests,
    wrappers, composer, distributed, script). Enables the CORE, GUI, MATH and
    VR support layers plus widgets — the set medInria links against.
  * Build against system Qt6 + zlib; -include cstdint for GCC 13+.

